Patch P1 for the libcosmic `iced` submodule (paths are relative to iced/).
Apply with scripts/libcosmic-patched.sh, never by hand.

iced_tiny_skia: when a frame has more than two damage rectangles, draw their
bounding box once instead of walking every layer (and redoing the clip mask)
once per rectangle. Adds `coalesce_damage` and `frame_damage` to
`iced_tiny_skia::window::compositor`, plus their tests.

